* Input of one TLV320ADC5140 channel as drawn in kicad/adc.kicad_sch:
* RX_OUT -> 2k -> (1k to GND) -> 100 nF -> INxP; the ADC input is 10 kohm (CHx_IMP = 01) to its
* internal common-mode bias (an AC ground). INxM is AC-grounded through 100 nF (single-ended).
* Full scale at the pin: 1 Vrms single-ended = +-1.414 V peak. The ADC's decimation filter is
* digital and flat to about 0.45 x 192 kHz = 86 kHz, so nothing else is modelled.
.subckt ADC_IN rx adc
Rtop rx div 2k
Rbot div 0 1k
Cc div adc 100n
Rin adc 0 10k
Cin adc 0 10p
.ends ADC_IN
